# Phase 11 (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.6, 7 criteria 6 and 8): Settings > EQ,
# the split value list: Off then the 22 presets. A preset sets the bands,
# turns the EQ on and sets the precut to its largest positive gain (Bass
# Booster: +5.5 dB = 55); Off turns it off. P15: with IPODUI_HW_EQ (on in
# the sim) Bass Booster fits the codec's EQ (maxerr 0.9 dB), so the
# software EQ stays off and flat (enabled=0 precut=0) and the engine line
# shows the hardware precut (6 dB).
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-eq.script
# needs: library
# log: eq preset=2 enabled=0 precut=0
# log: eq engine=hw preset=2 maxerr=9 precut=6
# log: eq preset=0 enabled=0 precut=0
# log: eq engine=sw preset=0 maxerr=0 precut=0
#
# Needs U2a's row wiring (Settings row 10 -> ui_eq_screen).

wait 4000
wheel +3             # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
wheel +9             # EQ
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
shot list_off        # Off highlighted, the EQ tile, caption "Off"
wheel +2             # Bass Booster
wait 1200
shot bass_booster    # the caption follows the highlight
key SELECT
wait 1200
key SELECT           # open it again: Bass Booster is highlighted
wait 1500
shot reopened
wheel -2             # Off
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
quit
